WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:05,090
You two are so annoyed, just laugh in the back

2
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,090
Classmate, don't run away

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:09,090
Your absolutely unwilling expressions are so beautiful.

4
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:25,100
Then burn you to death

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:31,100
The roasted meat must be very fragrant, right?
